# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo-wide ignore — keep build artifacts and OS junk out of version control.
# Each sub-project (e.g. web/) has its own .gitignore for project-specific
# rules. This file just covers things that can show up anywhere.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Accidental installs at the root (npm install should always run inside web/)
/node_modules
/package-lock.json
/package.json

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor metadata
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Env files (real secrets live inside web/.env)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
